# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# research/ — ungoverned exploration sandbox (D-35)
#
# geoai-skills and other exploratory tooling write bare .tif/.gpkg/.geojson
# with no checksum, no ModelRun, no registry entry and no official_warning
# marker. Those files are HYPOTHESES. Committing them would erase the
# distinction between sample, evidence and guess that the artifact lifecycle
# exists to create.
#
# Only the manifest is tracked, so the repository records what was tried and
# what was decided without carrying the outputs themselves. Promotion to
# evidence/ requires reproduction under realpipeline with a spatial holdout and
# a signed receipt — never a file copy. See ADR-I.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
research/**
!research/
!research/MANIFEST.md

# geoai-skills session state — a cache, never an input to a governed run (D-38)
.geoai-skills/
research/.venv-research/
.venv-research/
